        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia AP-9047P, Ultima IV Mitered Refrigerator Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Ultima IV Mitered Appliance Handle comes with hardware to mount it on an appliance panel. It can be used on vacuum sealed refrigerators as well as other high-end appliances. The Ultima IV Mitered Refrigerator Pull is available in 7 modern finishes. Choose from either 12 or 18 inch lengths.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso see the matching <a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/ultima-iv-mitered-cabinet-pull-omnia-9047-1250188\"><b>Ultima IV Mitered Cabinet Pulls</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia Ultima IV 9047P Appliance Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>AP-9047P/305:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-9047P/457:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
